msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MemoryBank|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Memory Bank"
msgstr "记忆库"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MemoryBank|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The lasting identity of a standing memory body rewritten over time. Its revisions are MemoryItems linked by versionOf; the bank identity carries no revision text."
msgstr "随时间改写的常设记忆主体的持久身份。各修订是通过 versionOf 关联的 MemoryItem；库身份本身不承载修订文本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MemoryBank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MemoryBank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MemoryBank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MemoryBank|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record a gmeow:MemoryBank ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record a gmeow:MemoryBank ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankTier|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Bank Audience Tier"
msgstr "记忆库受众层级"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open audience vocabulary for memory revisions and claims made of them, specializing ProjectionContext. It names who may receive a projection, independently of DisclosurePolicy posture and without certifying access enforcement."
msgstr "用于记忆修订及相关声明的开放受众词汇，特化自 ProjectionContext。它指明投影的接收者，独立于 DisclosurePolicy 披露姿态，且不认证访问控制执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record a gmeow:BankTier ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record a gmeow:BankTier ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReview|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Bank Review"
msgstr "记忆库审阅"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReview|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An Activity in which an agent reviews one exact memory-bank revision and records whether it read to the end and what it decided. A disposition records a decision, not proof that a later mutation or release occurred. Its eventTime is the recorded review-decision instant, including partial or deferred reviews, not the duration of reading."
msgstr "代理审阅某个确切记忆库修订并记录是否读完及所作决定的 Activity。处理决定仅记录决策，不证明后续修改或发布已经发生。 其 eventTime 是所记录的审阅决策时刻，包括部分阅读或推迟的情况，而非阅读持续时长。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReview|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReview|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReview|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReview|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record a gmeow:BankReview ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record a gmeow:BankReview ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReviewDisposition|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Bank Review Disposition"
msgstr "记忆库审阅决定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReviewDisposition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open vocabulary of decisions recorded during a bank review. Decisions may coexist; missing read-to-end evidence or a decision never means that a revision was fully read or kept unchanged."
msgstr "用于记忆库审阅所记录决定的开放词汇。各决定可共存；读完证据或决定缺失，绝不表示已完整阅读或保持修订不变。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReviewDisposition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReviewDisposition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReviewDisposition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BankReviewDisposition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record a gmeow:BankReviewDisposition ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record a gmeow:BankReviewDisposition ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BodyDistillation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Body Distillation"
msgstr "运行时保留的评价"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BodyDistillation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An agent’s appraisal in its own words kept on its behalf by its runtime and offered under the runtime’s standpoint. It is separate from a note the agent chose to keep and is not automatically the agent’s self-assertion."
msgstr "运行时代表代理保留、以代理自身措辞表达并在运行时立场下提供的评价。它区别于代理主动选择保留的笔记，也不会自动成为代理的自我声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BodyDistillation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BodyDistillation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BodyDistillation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BodyDistillation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record a gmeow:BodyDistillation ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record a gmeow:BodyDistillation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CurationEpoch|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Curation Epoch"
msgstr "整理阶段"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CurationEpoch|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A historical curation act described by original external source evidence, writing a successor ledger from a predecessor under a manifest and retaining an archive artifact. Its evidence remains outside migrated governed stores; it is no erasure tombstone or governed deletion receipt."
msgstr "由原始外部来源证据描述的历史整理行为，依据清单从前序账本写出后继账本并保留归档制品。其证据留在迁移后受治理存储之外；它既非擦除墓碑，也非受治理删除回执。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CurationEpoch|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CurationEpoch|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CurationEpoch|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CurationEpoch|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record a gmeow:CurationEpoch ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record a gmeow:CurationEpoch ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewKeep|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "keep revision"
msgstr "保留修订"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewKeep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer decided to keep the exact reviewed revision. This decision alone neither proves a complete read nor executes a store mutation."
msgstr "审阅者决定保留所审阅的确切修订。该决定本身既不证明完整阅读，也不执行存储修改。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewKeep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewKeep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewKeep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewKeep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewKeep ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewKeep ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewReplace|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "replace revision"
msgstr "替换修订"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewReplace|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer decided to replace the reviewed revision with a new one. Retain the old revision and lineage; the decision itself is not a replacement receipt."
msgstr "审阅者决定以新修订替换所审阅修订。须保留旧修订及沿袭关系；该决定本身不是替换回执。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewReplace|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewReplace|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewReplace|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewReplace|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewReplace ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewReplace ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewAppend|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "append to revision"
msgstr "追加修订"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewAppend|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer decided to append material in a successor revision. It does not silently modify the exact revision already reviewed."
msgstr "审阅者决定在后继修订中追加内容。它不会静默修改已审阅的确切修订。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewAppend|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewAppend|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewAppend|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewAppend|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewAppend ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewAppend ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewClear|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "clear revision body"
msgstr "清空修订正文"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewClear|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer decided to clear the bank’s current body in a successor revision. It is not authorization to erase revision history or the bank identity."
msgstr "审阅者决定在后继修订中清空记忆库当前正文。这不授权擦除修订历史或库身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewClear|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewClear|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewClear|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewClear|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewClear ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewClear ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRelabel|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relabel revision"
msgstr "重新标记修订"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRelabel|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer decided to change a revision’s label or classification. The decision does not imply unchanged content or confer a broader audience."
msgstr "审阅者决定修改修订的标签或分类。该决定不表示内容未变，也不授予更广受众。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRelabel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRelabel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRelabel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRelabel|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewRelabel ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewRelabel ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRestoreSnapshot|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "restore snapshot"
msgstr "恢复快照"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRestoreSnapshot|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer decided to restore a prior snapshot as a successor revision, preserving the original snapshot and intervening history."
msgstr "审阅者决定将先前快照恢复为后继修订，并保留原始快照及中间历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRestoreSnapshot|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRestoreSnapshot|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRestoreSnapshot|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRestoreSnapshot|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewRestoreSnapshot ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewRestoreSnapshot ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "propose wider audience version"
msgstr "提议更广受众版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer proposed a version for a wider audience. A proposal is not publication, permission or proof that the current revision may be released."
msgstr "审阅者提议面向更广受众的版本。提议不是发布、许可，也不证明当前修订可以披露。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewProposeWiderAudience ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewProposeWiderAudience ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewHandledPrivately|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "handled in private conversation"
msgstr "已在私下对话中处理"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewHandledPrivately|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The review was handled in a private conversation. This disposition makes no claim that the bank was unchanged and requires no exposure of private conversation text."
msgstr "审阅已在私下对话中处理。该决定不声称记忆库保持不变，也不要求公开私下对话文本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewHandledPrivately|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewHandledPrivately|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewHandledPrivately|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewHandledPrivately|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewHandledPrivately ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewHandledPrivately ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewDeferredChanged|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "deferred because bank changed"
msgstr "因记忆库变化而推迟"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewDeferredChanged|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer deferred because the bank changed during the review. The reviewedRevision still identifies the exact revision actually read, never a moving latest pointer."
msgstr "因记忆库在审阅期间变化而推迟。reviewedRevision 仍标识实际阅读的确切修订，绝非移动的最新版本指针。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewDeferredChanged|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewDeferredChanged|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewDeferredChanged|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewDeferredChanged|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewDeferredChanged ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewDeferredChanged ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/memoryText|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "memory text"
msgstr "记忆文本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/memoryText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The memory item’s verbatim prose as written by the remembering agent, retaining language and base direction. It is neither a summary nor a chosen note."
msgstr "记忆代理所写的记忆事项原文，保留语言及基方向。它既非摘要，也非主动选择的笔记。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/memoryText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/memoryText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/memoryText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/memoryText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record gmeow:memoryText \"Words retained.\"@en ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record gmeow:memoryText \"Words retained.\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankTier|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "bank audience tier"
msgstr "记忆库受众层级"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The audience classification of a revision or a statement about one. Statement annotations retain claim-specific audience scope; the value is separate from disclosure posture and does not certify enforcement."
msgstr "修订或其相关陈述的受众分类。陈述注释保留各声明特有的受众范围；该值独立于披露姿态，也不认证执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankTier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankTier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record gmeow:bankTier ex:value ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record gmeow:bankTier ex:value ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewedRevision|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reviewed revision"
msgstr "所审阅修订"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewedRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact MemoryItem revision read during this review, with a versionOf link to its lasting MemoryBank. It is not the bank’s latest revision by default."
msgstr "本次审阅阅读的确切 MemoryItem 修订，通过 versionOf 关联其持久 MemoryBank。它默认不是记忆库的最新修订。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewedRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewedRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewedRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewedRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record gmeow:reviewedRevision ex:value ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record gmeow:reviewedRevision ex:value ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readToEnd|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "read to end"
msgstr "已读至末尾"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readToEnd|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reported boolean of whether this exact revision was read to its end during this review. False is explicit partial reading; absence does not default to either value."
msgstr "报告本次审阅是否将该确切修订读至末尾的布尔值。false 显式表示部分阅读；缺失不默认成任一值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readToEnd|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readToEnd|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readToEnd|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readToEnd|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record gmeow:readToEnd false ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record gmeow:readToEnd false ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewDisposition|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "review disposition"
msgstr "审阅决定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewDisposition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A decision explicitly recorded by the review. Several decisions may coexist; none alone proves a complete read, an unchanged bank or execution of the proposed change."
msgstr "审阅显式记录的决定。多个决定可共存；任何单个决定都不独自证明完整阅读、记忆库未变或已执行所提议修改。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewDisposition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewDisposition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewDisposition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reviewDisposition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record gmeow:reviewDisposition ex:value ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record gmeow:reviewDisposition ex:value ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryText|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "summary text"
msgstr "摘要文本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The summary’s words verbatim as supplied by its summarizer, retaining language and base direction. The original source remains separate through wasDerivedFrom."
msgstr "摘要生成者提供的摘要原文，保留语言及基方向。原始来源通过 wasDerivedFrom 保持独立。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record gmeow:summaryText \"Words retained.\"@en ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record gmeow:summaryText \"Words retained.\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryAnchor|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "summary paraphrase anchor"
msgstr "摘要释义锚点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryAnchor|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A passage in the summarizer’s own wording identifying material it drew on. It is a paraphrase anchor, not a quotation of source words and not credited to the source author."
msgstr "摘要生成者以自身措辞指出所依据材料的段落。它是释义锚点，不是来源原文引文，也不归于来源作者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryAnchor|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryAnchor|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryAnchor|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryAnchor|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record gmeow:summaryAnchor \"Words retained.\"@en ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record gmeow:summaryAnchor \"Words retained.\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distilledText|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "kept appraisal text"
msgstr "所保留评价文本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distilledText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original appraisal words preserved by the runtime, with language and base direction. Keeping or offering them does not fabricate an agent-authored note or endorsement."
msgstr "运行时保留的原始评价措辞，附带语言及基方向。保留或提供这些措辞不会编造代理主动撰写的笔记或认可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distilledText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distilledText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distilledText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distilledText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record gmeow:distilledText \"Words retained.\"@en ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record gmeow:distilledText \"Words retained.\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distillationFor|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "appraisal beneficiary"
msgstr "评价受益代理"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distillationFor|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The Agent on whose behalf the runtime kept the appraisal. This role does not make that agent the keeper, the runtime standpoint or an endorsing author."
msgstr "运行时代其保留评价的 Agent。此角色不使该代理成为保留者、运行时立场或认可该文本的作者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distillationFor|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "用于保留有归属记忆记录的此部分或其确切来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distillationFor|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring endorsement, enforcement, a complete read or a governed store transition from a record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从记录推断认可、策略执行、完整阅读或受治理存储转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distillationFor|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep exact identities, original words and attributed scope; record missing evidence explicitly without inventing defaults."
msgstr "保留确切身份、原始措辞及归属范围；显式记录证据缺失，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distillationFor|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:record gmeow:distillationFor ex:value ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:record gmeow:distillationFor ex:value ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/curationManifest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "curation manifest artifact"
msgstr "整理清单制品"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/curationManifest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact original manifest artifact governing the historically described curation, with its own contentDigest. This reference does not authorize a new operation."
msgstr "支配所述历史整理的确切原始清单制品，带有自身 contentDigest。此引用不授权新操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/curationManifest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
